ce="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The invention provides a small-sized high-frequency module. To reduce the size of a high-frequency module, an integrated circuit (24) and chip capacitors (23a, 23b) connected electrically with it are placed in a recess (22), while a quartz oscillator (27) and a base (21) of substantially the same size are used. This configuration provides a small-sized high-frequency module.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un module hautes fréquences miniature. Pour réduire la taille de ce module hautes fréquences, on dispose un circuit intégré (24) et des condensateurs pastilles (23a, 23b) connectés électriquement au circuit intégré dans un évidement (22), et l'on utilise un oscillateur (27) à quartz et une base (21) ayant sensiblement la même taille. Cette configuration permet d'obtenir un module hautes fréquences de petite taille.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>